- '@id': https://chris-page-gov.github.io/okf-dwp/id/question/pc001
  route: question/pc001
  title: Where does the guide explain capital disregards?
  type: Question
  description: Start at chapter 84, PDF page 35 (DMG 84351–84353). The page references DMG Memo
    11/20 and legislation. Continue to adjacent pages for the surrounding section. The memo has not
    been consolidated into this bundle.
  status: draft
  tags:
  - unofficial
  - project-authored
  - question
  references:
  - story/capital-review
  - term/capital-disregards
  - chapter/84
  - page/84/0035
  resource:
    https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6a5e38bb8b7e4fa537e693d5/dmg-ch84.pdf#page=35
  sources:
  - id: dmg-vol14-ch84
    resource:
      https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6a5e38bb8b7e4fa537e693d5/dmg-ch84.pdf#page=35
    title: 'DMG Vol 14 Ch 84: Deemed weekly income from capital'
    author: organisation:dwp
  body: "# Where does the guide explain capital disregards?\n\nIndependent project-authored discovery
    aid; not an official interpretation or entitlement decision.\n\nStart at chapter 84, PDF page 35 (DMG
    84351–84353). The page references DMG Memo 11/20 and legislation. Continue to adjacent pages for the
    surrounding section. The memo has not been consolidated into this bundle.\n\nSource: [DMG Vol 14 Ch
    84: Deemed weekly income from capital, PDF page 35](https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6a5e38bb8b7e4fa537e693d5/dmg-ch84.pdf#page=35).\n\
    \nInspect the original and adjacent pages, footnotes, effective dates and cross-referenced memos.
    Source SHA-256: `f5c610b29bdb81e11736409b7f33ccf7917a4d8945f2821802801073e0d753ee`.\n"
- '@id': https://chris-page-gov.github.io/okf-dwp/id/question/pc002
  route: question/pc002
  title: Where are earnings and other income distinguished?
  type: Question
  description: Compare chapter 85, PDF page 4 with chapter 86, PDF pages 2–4. Locate categories and
    evidence; do not classify an individual claimant’s income automatically.
  status: draft
  tags:
  - unofficial
  - project-authored
  - question
  references:
  - story/income-map
  - term/earnings
  - term/income-other-than-earnings
  - chapter/85
  - page/85/0004
  - page/86/0002
  - page/86/0003
  - page/86/0004
  resource:
    https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/690b7db588a98da87e292365/dmg-ch-85.pdf#page=4
  sources:
  - id: dmg-vol14-ch85
    resource:
      https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/690b7db588a98da87e292365/dmg-ch-85.pdf#page=4
    title: 'DMG Vol 14 Ch 85: Income other than earnings '
    author: organisation:dwp
  - id: dmg-vol14-ch86-page2
    resource:
      https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/698462dd468d351e1406b4a7/dmgch86.pdf#page=2
    title: Chapter 86, PDF page 2
    author: organisation:dwp
  - id: dmg-vol14-ch86-page3
    resource:
      https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/698462dd468d351e1406b4a7/dmgch86.pdf#page=3
    title: Chapter 86, PDF page 3
    author: organisation:dwp
  - id: dmg-vol14-ch86-page4
    resource:
      https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/698462dd468d351e1406b4a7/dmgch86.pdf#page=4
    title: Chapter 86, PDF page 4
    author: organisation:dwp
  body: "# Where are earnings and other income distinguished?\n\nIndependent project-authored discovery
    aid; not an official interpretation or entitlement decision.\n\nCompare chapter 85, PDF page 4 with
    chapter 86, PDF pages 2–4. Locate categories and evidence; do not classify an individual claimant’s
    income automatically.\n\nSource: [DMG Vol 14 Ch 85: Income other than earnings , PDF page 4](https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/690b7db588a98da87e292365/dmg-ch-85.pdf#page=4).\n\
    \nInspect the original and adjacent pages, footnotes, effective dates and cross-referenced memos.
    Source SHA-256: `fe6fe79a4ff52271d6edf97af6b01ebd4290867b30d6288c38eb5e3a6d613c74`.\n\nComparison
    source: [chapter 86, PDF page 2](https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/698462dd468d351e1406b4a7/dmgch86.pdf#page=2).\n\
    \nComparison source: [chapter 86, PDF page 3](https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/698462dd468d351e1406b4a7/dmgch86.pdf#page=3).\n\
    \nComparison source: [chapter 86, PDF page 4](https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/698462dd468d351e1406b4a7/dmgch86.pdf#page=4).\n"
