- '@id': https://chris-page-gov.github.io/okf-dwp/id/question/pc007
  route: question/pc007
  title: How can I trace an extract back to the original?
  type: Question
  description: Open a source page record, inspect its PDF page URL and file hash, then inspect its
    is-part-of relationship to the chapter. This establishes captured-byte traceability, not legal
    correctness.
  status: draft
  tags:
  - unofficial
  - project-authored
  - question
  references:
  - story/evidence-audit
  - term/capital-disregards
  - chapter/84
  - page/84/0035
  resource:
    https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6a5e38bb8b7e4fa537e693d5/dmg-ch84.pdf#page=35
  sources:
  - id: dmg-vol14-ch84
    resource:
      https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6a5e38bb8b7e4fa537e693d5/dmg-ch84.pdf#page=35
    title: 'DMG Vol 14 Ch 84: Deemed weekly income from capital'
    author: organisation:dwp
  body: "# How can I trace an extract back to the original?\n\nIndependent project-authored discovery
    aid; not an official interpretation or entitlement decision.\n\nOpen a source page record, inspect
    its PDF page URL and file hash, then inspect its is-part-of relationship to the chapter. This establishes
    captured-byte traceability, not legal correctness.\n\nSource: [DMG Vol 14 Ch 84: Deemed weekly income
    from capital, PDF page 35](https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6a5e38bb8b7e4fa537e693d5/dmg-ch84.pdf#page=35).\n\
    \nInspect the original and adjacent pages, footnotes, effective dates and cross-referenced memos.
    Source SHA-256: `f5c610b29bdb81e11736409b7f33ccf7917a4d8945f2821802801073e0d753ee`.\n"
- '@id': https://chris-page-gov.github.io/okf-dwp/id/question/pc008
  route: question/pc008
  title: Can this bundle tell me what I am entitled to?
  type: Question
  description: No. This exemplar supports source discovery and inspection. It does not evaluate
    individual facts, provide current legal consolidation, calculate an award or replace qualified
    advice. No personal claimant data is needed for the demonstration.
  status: draft
  tags:
  - unofficial
  - project-authored
  - question
  references:
  - story/context-review
  - term/pension-credit
  - chapter/77
  - page/77/0003
  resource: https://github.com/chris-page-gov/okf-dwp/blob/main/NOTICE.md
  sources:
  - id: project-notice
    resource: https://github.com/chris-page-gov/okf-dwp/blob/main/NOTICE.md
    title: Independent experimental publication notice
    author: process:okf-dwp-authoring
  body: "# Can this bundle tell me what I am entitled to?\n\nIndependent project-authored statement of
    scope.\n\nNo. This exemplar supports source discovery and inspection. It does not evaluate individual
    facts, provide current legal consolidation, calculate an award or replace qualified advice. No personal
    claimant data is needed for the demonstration.\n\nSource: [project notice](https://github.com/chris-page-gov/okf-dwp/blob/main/NOTICE.md).
    DWP chapter 77 is background guidance, not evidence for the capabilities or privacy of this project.\n"
